IMAPAccount mailattic-remote
Host ${IMAP_HOST}
Port ${IMAP_PORT}
User ${IMAP_USER}
Pass ${IMAP_PASSWORD}
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN
PipelineDepth 1
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore mailattic-remote-store
Account mailattic-remote

MaildirStore mailattic-local-store
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ${MAILDIR_ROOT}/${IMAP_ACCOUNT_NAME}/
Inbox ${MAILDIR_ROOT}/${IMAP_ACCOUNT_NAME}/INBOX

Channel mailattic-channel
Far :mailattic-remote-store:
Near :mailattic-local-store:
${MBSYNC_PATTERNS_LINE}
Create Near
Expunge None
Sync Pull
SyncState *

Group mailattic-sync
Channel mailattic-channel
